WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.680
Sh-Shuri?

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:10.890
Why does she have these articles?

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.530
I'm Yo Susugihara.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.190
Don't worry about remembering my name.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.930
I can't do it.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.020
Tomo!

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.220
Misao!

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:26.870
Yukari!

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:28.980
The Asura Machina...

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:30.620
She's...

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.300
She's...

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:49.570
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:07.290
"Sacrifice Beyond the Darkness"

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:15.930
It's over.

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:17.360
Good work.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:20.680
I've got to stop by somewhere on the way back.

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:21.940
Stop by? Where?

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.330
Yes. It's not too far out of the way.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.720
I'll be done in the blink of an eye.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:30.480
That's that.

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:33.310
Has Yo decided to start trying?

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.020
Seems like it.

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:38.020
How terrifying.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.510
Looks like we woke him.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.290
W-what are you doing?

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.310
What do you mean?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.500
We're wiping off your sweat.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.580
Right, Kanade?

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:18.790
I'll do it myself.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.390
We don't mind.

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.580
Have some ginger tea.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:31.190
Um...

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.020
Are you... Shuri?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:34.940
Yes.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.650
So your memory returned?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:38.460
Yes, thanks to you.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:39.890
You're really Shuri?

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.630
You're not Yukari, but Shuri?

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.400
What, Tomoharu?

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:46.280
Did you miss me that badly?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:47.710
No.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.620
Who is Yukari?

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.900
What does she have to do with you?

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.160
Well, um...

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.800
Oh, no. My memory's fuzzy.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:01.800
Hello.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.630
I wonder who's calling.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:04.550
Hel...

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.430
Do you want to make a deal, Shuri?

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:11.380
You have the real stabilizer, don't you?

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:13.900
I'll take that as a yes.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.160
Then we have a deal.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:19.670
Who's exchanging what and when?

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.630
I'll trade you this precious letter of yours I have.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:25.550
What? Is that...

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.230
I'm on my way.

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:27.490
Have it ready.

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:35.010
Uh, Shuri?

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.920
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.940
What are those panties doing in my room?

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:46.580
They're for me.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:49.070
No one wants to wear sweaty clothes.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.230
Wait a minute.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.940
You're not listening to me.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.570
What is that?

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:56.520
A stabilizer.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.460
A stabilizer?

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.410
Wasn't it stolen?

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:04.580
This is the real thing.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:09.150
But forget about that.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.120
Let's take care of that cold.

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:15.540
I'm fine the way I am.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.310
No you're not.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.330
Yo is on her way here.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:22.470
Wanting to make a trade for the stabilizer.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:26.670
Is it important?

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:33.390
Who is Susugihara?

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.510
Yo is a G.D.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:38.930
A guardian dragoon of the Kanto Student Union.

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:43.640
She's the previous Student Council President of Rakurowa High School.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.030
Previous president?

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:49.610
So she was the president before President Saeki.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:50.570
Right.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.230
Yo was recruited by the Student Union...

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:56.200
...so Reishiro is the president as a sophomore.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.820
Is she also an Asura Machina handler?

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.620
Yes. And a dangerous one, to boot.

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.540
To fend off Yo...

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.650
...we'll need your Asura Machina.

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:07.920
Kurogane?

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:19.970
Okay.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.340
Here, Tomoharu.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:24.960
And now we just...

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.050
What was that for?

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:32.370
"Pickled Plums"

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.360
Well? Feeling better?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:36.630
How is that folk medicine supposed to make me feel better?

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:39.330
Maybe you're just lacking determination.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.000
Hurry up and get better.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:44.550
You seem pretty desperate.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:46.020
Sh-shut up.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.580
What about you, Kanade?

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.970
Do you know any ways to cure a cold in a hurry?

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.020
Oh, um...

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.690
I know.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:59.070
...and now we just need to apply frog urine.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.870
Um, Ritsu could...

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.400
I know it's in here somewhere...

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:04.670
Here we are!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.010
Ritsu could make some medicine!

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.920
...I think.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:12.730
Good idea.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:15.930
What's going on?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.140
Let's go, Tomoharu, Kanade.

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:26.690
Call a taxi.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.410
Going somewhere?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:32.290
Do you have something more important to do than meet with me?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.120
The Second Student Council has lost a lot of dignity...

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:39.020
...to be unable to meet with someone of my rank.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:43.010
Hand over the stabilizer.

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:44.110
No.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:46.220
Still haven't learned your lesson?

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.270
Even after all of that?

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:54.350
Are you the one that hurt Shuri?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:04.630
Draw, Shirogane.

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:25.390
Kurogane?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.050
Cutting space itself.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.850
That's the power of Yo's Asura Machina.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:37.990
Let's go.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.270
Take us to the Ayashima church.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:58.650
Um...

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:01.620
What is a stabilizer?

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.010
It's a plug-in for the Asura Machina.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.400
An add-on component that expands the Asura Machina's powers.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:07.800
Add-on component?

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.950
I got it with the intention of disassembling it.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.000
I wanted to know how it's made.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.270
Then what's a burial doll?

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.010
The sacrifice made to the Asura Machina.

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:23.400
It's something like a living spirit.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.470
It's the sacrifice bound inside the Asura Machina.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:28.730
I can't do it, Tomo!

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:36.340
The stabilizer is most likely the key to releasing the burial doll from its Asura Machina.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:37.840
Release?

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:43.720
Does that mean I can bring Misao back to life?

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:45.020
Then...

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.380
You can't run.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.840
We'll see about that.

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:10.150
From this distance...!

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:14.380
What?

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:15.580
This way.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:25.790
Wait here.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.390
"Flight 901 Crashes"

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.390
"More than 100 Dead"

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:50.440
Sorry to make you wait.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.470
Sh-Shuri...

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:56.000
I can't...

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:56.690
Tomoharu!

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:02.630
I told you you can't run.

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:16.320
Let's go.

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.810
You can't get us up here.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.680
I guess the deal's off, then.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.220
More trouble?

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:50.770
Ritsu, has it arrived yet?

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:52.140
It's outside.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.730
Take care of him.

00:11:58.490 --> 00:11:59.410
How long do I have?

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:02.420
Five... no, three minutes.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.570
I'll get you as much time as I can.

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:06.520
Got it.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:17.270
Something's brewing.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.510
A stabilizer, huh?

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:27.820
Kanade. Lay Tomoharu on his stomach.

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:28.740
Yes.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.270
Done playing games?

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:41.000
It's time for me to take you out.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.770
A defense howitzer?

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:59.030
Let's try this out.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.200
Shuri...

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:29.320
Stop, Tomoharu.

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:33.040
But Shuri doesn't stand a chance.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:36.220
Then hurry up and reduce that fever.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.220
Did you prepare some medicine?

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.010
Yes.

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:44.240
Don't worry.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.430
It might hurt a little at first...

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.000
...but you'll get used to it.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:50.690
Are those...?

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:51.820
Suppositories.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:53.120
Kanade.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:54.930
Yes.

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:56.640
Wait, Takatsuki!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.730
You've got to relax.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.810
You'll be fine, Tomoharu.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:00.900
Fine?

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.020
I'm the class nurse.

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:31.740
I'll give you back your letter...

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.200
...if you'll hand over the stabilizer.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.030
Never.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.980
I don't give up.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.060
Why do you care so much?

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:43.450
We're needed.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.670
"We?"

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:50.070
The stabilizer belongs with the G.D.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.420
If you give me the stabilizer...

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:56.800
...I can forgive you for shooting a G.D.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.280
Because of my girlfriend.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:04.420
You couldn't even tell us apart.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:14.490
Shooting from despair blacker than darkness.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.350
The fang that mourns the guilt of science.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:24.660
You sacrificed yourself for your own Asura Machina?

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:28.860
Rising from the abyss deeper than darkness.

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:31.560
My sister... Shuri...

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:34.430
The sword that judges the illusion of science.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.790
I know you know.

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:57.270
Nothing can stand against Shirogane's power.

00:15:58.670 --> 00:15:59.530
For now, anyway.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:11.380
Your actions amount to nothing more than foolishness.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:13.560
It's complacent.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:18.850
It was more than that.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:21.380
You're the only one who thought it was pointless.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.530
Tomoharu Natsume's projection body?

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:30.020
Come, Kurogane.

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.330
From the abyss blacker than darkness.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.400
The shadow cast by the light of science.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.780
Don't be foolish.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.270
If you give me the stabilizer...

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.690
...I promise I'll harm no one else.

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:03.450
I'll never give you the stabilizer.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:27.590
Kurogane!

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:29.880
Shirogane!

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:40.200
"Darkness"

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.460
A gravity sphere to bend space?

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:52.410
This can't be good.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:54.410
What was that?

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:08.260
Stop, Shirogane.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.070
Destroy the stabilizer.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:14.330
Stop!

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:24.070
No! Protect it, Kurogane!

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:29.870
Impossible.

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:42.370
No! If an Asura Machina touches the stabilizer...

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:16.040
Well done, Tomoharu Natsume.

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:17.780
Uh...

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:20.000
Looks like it got eaten.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:26.860
I guess so.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:29.560
It's not something to laugh about.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.300
But...

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:33.300
What's this?

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:38.300
Would it be alright if I called you my sister?

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:41.370
The first time I saw you at the entrance ceremony...

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:47.720
Those precious memories.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.120
Don't give me that.

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:51.580
Yo, you're a creep.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.580
Why would you even hold on to this?

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:56.740
Shuri was so cute during middle school.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.740
Yo!

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:02.880
Um, is that what you were going to trade?

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:03.810
Yes.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.270
Seriously?

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.620
I'm going home. Keep up the good work, Tomoharu.

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:11.630
She's gone.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:13.670
"Keep up the good work?"

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:15.110
I don't know.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.580
Did you work things out?

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:21.900
I guess.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:43.450
Oh, no. I haven't studied at all.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.720
Looks like you're over your cold, Tomo.

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:50.010
Took a suppository, did you?

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:52.430
Just kidding.

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:54.000
But more importantly, check this out.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.780
I found something great.

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:56.870
Great?

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.870
You'll see.

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:01.040
"Movie Hi"

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:00.450
What's this?

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:03.460
Is this...?

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:05.750
Child actor prodigies?

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.850
"Shuri Kurosaki (older) Yukari Kurosaki (younger)"

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:07.350
Shuri.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:08.510
Yukari.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:09.710
Twins?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.150
Good morning.

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:23.780
Um.

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.000
It's rather sudden...

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:29.610
...but I'd like to introduce you to our new transfer student.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.520
I'm sure some of you know her already...

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:35.660
...as the ghost that follows Mr. Natsume.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.840
I'm Misao Minakami.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.440
Nice to meet you.

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:43.850
Misao?

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:47.440
Make her feel welcome.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.750
"Preview"

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:22.400
Everything was rosy.

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:24.520
Full of happiness and hope...

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:26.190
...always together.

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:28.100
Until that day.

00:23:28.480 --> 00:23:30.700
Everything ended.

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:31.550
Began.

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:35.020
"The Dream that Dispersed in the Heartless Sky"
